{
  "$comment": [
    "前后端接口契约 · intraday.json（V5.3 同步机制 · 2026-10-05）",
    "生产方：scripts/snapshot_intraday.mjs（绝不触碰 archive.json；仅 meta.phase==='live' 时前端才拉）",
    "消费方：app.js loadIntraday——kind:'intraday' 是防串档哨兵（拉到别的档直接判失败）"
  ],
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["kind", "version", "tradeDate", "capturedAtBJ", "hot", "pools", "breadth"],
  "properties": {
    "kind": { "type": "string", "const": "intraday" },
    "version": { "type": "number" },
    "tradeDate": { "type": "string" },
    "capturedAtBJ": { "type": "string" },
    "prevCapturedAtBJ": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
    "phase": { "type": "string" },
    "caliberNote": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
    "hot": {
      "type": ["object", "null"],
      "required": ["count"],
      "properties": {
        "count": { "type": "number" },
        "srcDate": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
        "rows": { "type": "array" }
      }
    },
    "pools": {
      "type": ["object", "null"],
      "required": ["zt", "zb", "dt", "max_lb", "lb2"],
      "properties": {
        "zt": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "zb": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "dt": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "max_lb": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "lb2": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "seal_pct": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "zt_codes": { "type": "array" }
      }
    },
    "prevPools": {
      "type": ["object", "null"],
      "$comment": "上一拍成功快照的池对比面：只存前端实际消费的三字段（app.js 盘中卡 zt/zb/seal_pct 的 delta 对比；dt/max_lb/lb2 当前值直显不做对比）。原五字段（zt/zb/dt/max_lb/lb2）是 33482e5 契约先行时的预设，4bb6965 落地时按消费面实现为三字段，2026-10-08 契约对齐实现（节后首日 prevPools 首次非 null 暴露缺口）",
      "required": ["zt", "zb", "seal_pct"],
      "properties": {
        "zt": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "zb": { "type": ["number", "null"] },
        "seal_pct": { "type": ["number", "null"] }
      }
    },
    "breadth": { "type": ["object", "null"] },
    "sourcesFailed": { "type": "array" }
  }
}
